OL,3,GNEWSABell rung to mark the start of
OL,4,A732nd Hull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 732nd Hull Fair is officially under
OL,7,Fway.
OL,9,FIn keeping with tradition, the city's
OL,10,FLord Mayor, Councillor Maria Coward,
OL,11,Frang the bell on the waltzer ride to
OL,12,Fmark the start of the event at 16:00
OL,13,FBST on Friday.
OL,15,FThe annual event, one of the largest
OL,16,Ftravelling fairs in Europe, has more
OL,17,Fthan 300 attractions this year.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
