OL,3,GNEWSABell rung to mark the start of
OL,4,A732nd Hull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FShowman Richard Story, who first worked
OL,7,Fat the fair as a teenager 60 years ago,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It's not just a fair, it's a
OL,9,Ftradition. It's what we do. It never
OL,10,Fceases to amaze me, the calibre of the
OL,11,Fequipment, that's on this fairground."
